---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="How Limitless PA handles the information you share with us.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>Short version: we only collect what you choose to send us, and we don’t sell or share it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you fill out a form on this site — suggesting a place, sharing an event, or contacting us — we receive what you
        type into it, such as your name, email address, and message. We use it only to review your submission and, if
        needed, follow up with you.
      </p>
      <h2>What we don’t do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We don’t sell, rent, or trade your information.</li>
        <li>We don’t use advertising trackers.</li>
        <li>We don’t publish your name or email with a listing unless you ask us to.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Services we use</h2>
      <p>
        This site is hosted by Netlify, which also processes our form submissions. Fonts are served by Google Fonts. These
        providers may log basic technical information (like your IP address) to deliver the site.
      </p>
      <h2>Children’s information</h2>
      <p>
        Please don’t include your child’s full name, diagnosis, or other private health details in our forms. We don’t need
        them to add a listing.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Want us to delete something you sent? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a> and we’ll take care of it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
